                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is great! I love Picross/Nonograms. Workshop support out of the box is incredible, though it will be nice if/when you add more included puzzles.\n\nCouple other bits of feedback: I keep accidentally hitting pieces, usually when they first spawn. Maybe they should be \"invincible\" for a couple seconds? Or maybe only count a hit when hammer velocity is over some threshold? Also I personally would prefer if the switch between hammer and highlight were a toggle instead of holding the trigger, and on that note would be cool if the when highlighting the hammer changed to a marker or something. I reailze this just came out on Early Access so you might have some of these things planned!\n\nAnyway, keep up the great work!",
